ROUTE UranusOInter.value_changed TO UranusOrbit.set_rotation

ROUTE TimerNeptune.fraction_changed TO NeptuneOInter.set_fraction
ROUTE TimerNeptune2.fraction_changed TO NeptuneOInter2.set_fraction
ROUTE NeptuneOInter.value_changed TO NeptuneOrbit.set_rotation

ROUTE MercuryOInter2.value_changed TO MERCURY.rot
ROUTE VenusOInter2.value_changed TO VENUS.rot
ROUTE EarthOInter2.value_changed TO EARTH.rot
ROUTE MarsOInter2.value_changed TO MARS.rot
ROUTE JupiterOInter2.value_changed TO JUPITER.rot
ROUTE SaturnOInter2.value_changed TO SATURN.rot
ROUTE UranusOInter2.value_changed TO URANUS.rot
ROUTE NeptuneOInter2.value_changed TO NEPTUNE.rot